  "bodyHash": "520ec8be8d0ee1fa",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">简易铁砧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 使铁砧更加便捷、减少挫败感，并大幅提升实用性。🔨 关闭界面时物品仍保留其中，且内容会直接渲染在方块上，带来更沉浸的体验。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组还对多项原版铁砧机制进行了重构，避免了修装备和附魔升级时的繁琐操作。重复使用惩罚大幅降低，修理费用能长时间保持合理，多项常见操作的消耗也变得更加亲民。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">从修复破损铁砧到免费重命名及格式支持，本模组提供了一系列生活质量改进，让铁砧在全流程游戏中都变得更好用。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铁砧状态持久化：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 关闭界面后物品仍保留在铁砧中，不会弹回背包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可见内容：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 放入铁砧的物品会直接渲染在世界中的方块上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">降低重复使用惩罚：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 修理和重命名不再受快速累积的重复使用费用影响。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔成本更低：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔书应用费用降低，昂贵操作的限制大幅放宽。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">免费重命名：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可为物品重命名而无需消耗经验等级。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">格式支持：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 物品名称支持格式代码，可自定义颜色与文本样式。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">修复破损铁砧：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 使用铁块即可修复铁砧，延长其使用寿命。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铁砧更耐用：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 铁砧在使用过程中损坏或破碎的概率大幅降低。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可精细调整修理费用、重复使用惩罚、耐久度及众多其他机制。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric & NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模组支持，可通过游戏内模组菜单直接进行配置（Fabric 版需安装由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 作者 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 开发）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tfarecnim\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tfarecnim</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 及其开发的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Anvil Tweaks</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 与 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-repair\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Anvil Repair</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组，本模组很大程度上基于它们制作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/elhertz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">elhertz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 建议的铁砧最大附魔等级修复方案。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/Illios42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Illios42</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 建议的功能，允许在铁砧和命名牌界面中使用 Minecraft 格式代码对文本进行样式设置。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-masquerade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/goldenagecombat/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
